---
import Button from "./Button.astro";
---

<section
	id="about"
	class="scroll-mt-20 bg-[#f7f7f9] py-20 text-brand-ink md:py-[6.5rem]"
	aria-labelledby="approach-heading"
>
	<div class="site-grid items-center gap-y-12">
		<figure class="col-span-4 m-0 md:col-span-6 md:w-[calc(100%+1rem)]">
			<img
				src="/images/general-images/image (27).png"
				alt="Water flowing over a moss-covered stone wall surrounded by greenery."
				class="aspect-3/2 h-auto w-full object-cover outline outline-1 outline-black/10"
				width="612"
				height="408"
				loading="lazy"
				decoding="async"
			/>
		</figure>

		<div class="col-span-4 md:col-start-8 md:col-span-5">
			<p class="font-sans text-xs font-normal leading-none tracking-[0.08em] text-brand-sand uppercase">Our approach</p>
			<h2
				id="approach-heading"
				class="mt-4 max-w-[12em] font-brand text-[26px] font-normal leading-[1.05] tracking-[-0.035em] [text-wrap:balance] md:text-[28px]"
			>
				A practice shaped by presence, dignity, and care
			</h2>

			<div class="mt-6 h-0.5 w-20 bg-brand-sand" aria-hidden="true"></div>

			<div class="mt-7 space-y-3 text-base leading-[1.5] font-normal [text-wrap:pretty] md:max-w-[32rem]">
				<p>
					We were both moved by the Zulu greeting Sawbona, which means, &quot;I see you, I
					hear you, I feel you.&quot; It is a deep way of acknowledging a person&apos;s presence
					and a recognition of their worth, dignity, and value.
				</p>
				<p>
					We were both moved by the Zulu greeting Sawbona, which means, &quot;I see you, I
					hear you, I feel you.&quot; It is a deep way of acknowledging a person&apos;s presence
					and a recognition of their worth, dignity, and value.
				</p>
			</div>

			<div class="mt-8">
				<Button href="#contact" size="compact" class="rounded-[9px]">Book an appointment</Button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
